@startuml
actor User
participant RS as "Resume Service"
participant TS as "Template Service"
participant PS as "Payment Service"
participant AI as "AI Engine"
participant Admin
participant NS as "Notification Service"

' Start of process
User -> RS: 1. Click 'Build Your CV or Upload CV'
RS -> TS: 2. Prompt to Choose Template
TS -> User: 3. Display Template Options
User -> TS: 4. Select Template
TS -> RS: 5. Send Selected Template
RS -> User: "6. Prompt to Fill Details Manually or with AI\n(Contact, Experience, Education, etc.)"
User -> RS: 7. Submit Details or Job Descriptions

alt "AI Assistance Needed"
  RS -> AI: 8. Generate Experience from Job Descriptions
  RS -> AI: 9. Generate Skills if not provided
  RS -> AI: 10. Generate Summary if not provided
  AI -> RS: 11. Return AI-generated Experience, Skills, Summary
  RS -> User: 12. Display AI-generated content
  User -> RS: 13. Confirm or Edit AI content
end

RS -> User: 14. Display 'CV Creation Completed'
RS -> User: 15. Choose Option:\n a) £4 Download/Email\n b) £50/£80 Expert Review
User -> RS: 16. Select Option

alt "£4 Plan Selected"
  User -> PS: 17. Select £4 Plan
  PS -> PS: 18. Process Payment
  PS -> RS: 19. Confirm Payment
  RS -> User: 20. Prompt Login/Register
  User -> RS: 21. Login/Register
  RS -> User: 22. Provide Download Link (PDF/DOC)
  RS -> User: 23. Send CV to Email
  RS -> User: 24. Offer Upgrade to Expert Review

else "£50/£80 Plan Selected"
  User -> PS: 25. Select £50/£80 Plan
  PS -> PS: 26. Process Payment
  PS -> RS: 27. Confirm Payment
  RS -> User: 28. Prompt Login/Register
  User -> RS: 29. Login/Register
  RS -> Admin: 30. Assign CV to Expert
  RS -> User: 31. Display 'Review in Progress'
  Admin -> RS: 32. Update CV
  Admin -> RS: 33. Complete Review and Feedback
  RS -> NS: 34. Notify User of Completion
  NS -> User: 35. Send Notification
  RS -> User: 36. Update Status to Completed
  User -> RS: 37. Login to View Reviewed CV
  RS -> User: 38. Display CV and Feedback
  RS -> User: 39. Provide Download Link (PDF/DOC)
  RS -> User: 40. Send CV to Email
  User -> RS: 41. Download CV
end
@enduml
